# Tailscale WireGuard Bypass Rules
# DERP 服务器使用普通公网 IP，Clash TUN auto-route 会劫持 WireGuard 外层 UDP
# 导致 NAT 打洞失败，全走 DERP 中继
# 这些 IP-CIDR 规则确保 WireGuard 外层 UDP 直连
IP-CIDR,192.200.0.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,159.89.225.99/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,167.172.206.31/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,68.183.179.66/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,167.172.182.26/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,103.43.75.49/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,68.183.90.120/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,167.179.89.145/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,167.71.139.179/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,207.148.3.137/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,137.220.36.168/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,18.230.97.74/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,216.128.144.130/32,no-resolve
